        <p>The Rylands' Recreation v Barton match, which should have been played last Saturday, is not included in the above table. Barton were unable to raise a team Itylands' team to-day at Gorsey-lane against Salford Sr. Barts will be: Bramhell, full back; Griffiths. Leah, Potter and Hennessey, three-quarters; Floyd and Horrocks, half backs; Mason, Morris Stretford, Brandwood, Broadhurst and Booth, forwards.</p>
