      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-10-19_WidnesExaminer_art0034" n="art0034">
        <head>CIATION FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>CIATION FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>ASsOCIATION FOOTBALL. NORTH CHESHIRE LEAGUE. FIRST DIVISION.</p>
        <p>Goals.</p>
        <p>P. W. L. D. Fo-r-Ag'st Pts Lostock Oral= Barnton Villa Broadheath Lymm 2 1 0.. I 5.. 4. 3 Oughtrington Park 3... 1... 1... 3... 2... 2... 3 Mobberley Latchford Bowdon Vale Altrincham Lads 3. 0.. 1. 9 4.. 5... 2 _</p>
        <p>Oughtrington Amat 2... 0... 2... 0... 4... 12... 0 St Vincents MOBBERLET V. ST. VINCENT'S.</p>
        <p>At Mobberley on Saturday afternoon, this being the home team's first League engagement. Half-time : Mobberlev three goals ; St. Vincent's nil. In the second half play was even and no further scoring took place.</p>
