      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-10-19_WidnesExaminer_art0090" n="art0090">
        <p>P.D.C.R. Bro J Walsh, senior district trustee, then presented the retiring D.C.R , Bro Baines, with his Past District Chief Ranger's ribbon of office. It gave him great pleasure in doing this as all felt he had rendered to the Warrington District great and valu- able services. Bro Baines thanked the meeting for the honour they had bestowed up,n him that day and assured them that what be had done in the past he would endeavour to do in the future. Bro T Roden then formally closed the meeting.</p>
