        <p>Letters from people who ha received great bertafi rfom the use of Clarke's Blood Mixture. It cannot be too highly estimated for it cleanses and clears the bleed from all Impurities. This is a good testimonial from the "Family Doctor" which goes on further to say: "It is the finest Bloods Purifier that science and skill have brought to light, and we can with the utmost confidence recommend it to our subscribers and the public generally. For Scrofula, Scurvy, Eczema Bad Legs, Skin and Blood Diseases, Pimples and sores of all kinds the effects are marvellous. Thousands oi testimonials. Clarke's Blood Mixture is sold every- where at 2s. 9d. per bottle. Beware of worthless mitations and substitutes.—Advt. 4 CLARKE'S B, 41 PILLS are warranted to cure in either sex all acquired or constitutional discharges, from the Urinary Organs, Gravel and Pains in the back. Free from Mercury. Established npwards of 40 years. In boxes 40. ed. each, of all chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors throughout the world, or send for sixty stamps by the makers The Lincoln and Midland Counties Drug Co.,Linooln.--Advt.</p>
