      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-10-19_WidnesExaminer_art0103" n="art0103">
        <head>PLAYING AT THE ROYAL COURT THEATRE,</head>
        <p>PLAYING AT THE ROYAL COURT THEATRE,</p>
        <p>NEXT WEEK.</p>
        <p>• . . . ' • • • • ,• • • • • • , , • .':•4•••`• •"Y • •-•::</p>
